arn More &gt;</a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iidAxk ijzYPE pf-398_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-fTQwFj dquNLz pf-399_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">IAPD/IPRA Soaring to New Heights Conference — January&nbsp;23 - 24, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-fTQwFj dquNLz pf-401_ pf-heading-1-h3">Hyatt Regency – Chicago, IL</h3><p class="sc-hatNQy cryxqU pf-403_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">The IAPD/IPRA Soaring to New Heights Conference holds the unique distinction of being the largest state park and recreation conference in the nation. The conference brings together thousands of professionals, Commissioners, and elected officials from around the state for three exciting days of quality educational programming, networking, and professional development. Visit Russo at Booth #234.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.ilparksconference.com/" target="_blank"><b><a href="https://www.ilparksconference.com/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iidAxk ijzYPE pf-405_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-fTQwFj dquNLz pf-406_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Lawn Care Application Timing — January&nbsp;15, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-fTQwFj dquNLz pf-408_ pf-heading-1-h3">Russo: New Berlin, WI — 11:00AM Social &amp; Lunch, 1:00PM Seminar Starts</h3><p class="sc-hatNQy cryxqU pf-410_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><strong>Have questions about applying plant health care products like fertilizers, chemicals, or seed?&nbsp;</strong>Join us for this engaging seminar with Larry Vogel (Spring Valley), Patrick Bastron (PBI Gordon), and Rob Osier (Russo Plant&nbsp;Health Care Manager). They'll address common concerns and share practical tips to boost your confiden