8:15am - Competition preliminary events begin</b><br><br>We’re heading to the IAA Tree Climbing Championship for a day full of competition, fun, and outdoor activities. Our certified arborist, Dan, will be judging the competition and we'll have a booth at the fair. Stop by to learn more about all things arbor! <a href="https://illinoisarborist.org/2022-illinois-tree-climbing-championship/" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dkqRie kxkqmn pf-1041_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-fTQwFj dquNLz pf-1045_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live Online Auction — June 15</b></h3><p class="sc-hatNQy cryxqU pf-1047_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Elgin </b>- 1001 N Randall Rd, Elgin, IL 60123, USA<b><br><br>Consign By:</b> 5/21   |   <b>Preview Day:</b> 6/14</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dkqRie kxkqmn pf-1049_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-fTQwFj dquNLz pf-1053_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Chainsaw Safety Seminar — June 10</b></h3><p class="sc-hatNQy cryxqU pf-1055_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Hainesville </b>- 39 East Belvidere Road, Hainesville, IL 60030, USA<br><br>Earn 1.5 ISA CEUs while learning about the best chainsaw safety practices from a certified chainsaw technician. We’ll cover and discuss all the basics from chainsaw starting, usage, handling, maintenance, and more.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dkqRie kxkqmn pf-1057_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-fTQwFj dquNLz pf-1061_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>APWA Chicago Expo &amp; Roadeo — May 18 &amp; 19</b></h3><p class="sc-hatNQy cryxqU pf-1063_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Odeum Expo Center in Villa Park, IL</b><br><br>While attending the APWA Expo, stop by our booth, say hi, and we’ll fill you in on all of the exciting news and equipment we have in stock! <a href="http://chicago.apwa.net/Content/Chapters/chicago.apwa.net/Documents/2022%20APWA%20CMC%20Expo%20Exhibitor%20Sponsor%20Information(3).pdf" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dkqRie kxkqmn pf-1065_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-fTQwFj dquNLz pf-1069_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;In-Person Auction — April 9</b></h3><p class="sc-hatNQy cryxqU pf-1071_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Auction begins at 8:00am at Russo:</b> Hainesville   |   <b>Preview Day:</b> 04/08, Hainesville<br><br>After a long break due to Covid, we're excited to announce the return of our in-person auction! Plan to spend the day bidding on an assortment of high-quality used equipment.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dkqRie kxkqmn pf-1073_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-fTQwFj dquNLz pf-1077_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Russo Spring Open House</b></h3><p class="sc-hatNQy cryxqU pf-1079_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We’re happy to announce the long-awaited return of the Russo Open House! Spring Open House features representatives from the most prominent companies in the industry putting on demonstrations and informing customers of the newest products on the market. Save the date for a day full of fun, raffles, giveaways, and more.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dkqRie kxkqmn pf-1081_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-fTQwFj dquNLz pf-1085_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;Online Auction — March 16</b></h3><p class="sc-hatNQy cryxqU pf-1087_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>No Consignment   |   Preview Day:</b> 03/15, Elgin</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dkqRie kxkqmn pf-1089_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-fTQwFj dquNLz pf-1093_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Service Hiring Event at Schiller Park — March 10 &amp; 11</b></h3><p class="sc-hatNQy cryxqU pf-1095_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>In-person Interviews &amp; On-the-spot Offers<br></b><br>Meet the staff, see the space, have some food, and have an in-person interview with potential offers! We're hiring multiple people for 3 positions: Service Porters, Service Mechanics, &amp; Lead Service Advisor. All mechanic levels from apprentice to master are welcome to apply! Visit <a href="/pages/careers" target="_self">RussoPower.com/careers</a>&nbsp;7 to see all job opportunities!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>
